repository-code: https://github.com/siddhi-lad/MLPRoadNet-SpaceNet-Vegas

abstract: >
  MLPRoadNet is a deep learning framework for automatic road extraction
  from high-resolution satellite imagery using a custom CNN-based
  architecture evaluated on the SpaceNet Vegas dataset.

